{"about_the_game":"<i>Stranded on an uncharted planet after a harrowing crash landing, you find yourself navigating treacherous depths in an underground labyrinth. Try to get back to your ship quickly, you don't wanna know what dug those tunnels...</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/c620c03f26de9183367b9b982ea5a0bd.poster.avif?t=1764933615\" width=506 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/c620c03f26de9183367b9b982ea5a0bd.webm?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/c620c03f26de9183367b9b982ea5a0bd.mp4?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flee with Flair</h2><strong>This Is No Cave</strong> is a minimalist, fast-paced 2d platformer playable with just your mouse (controller supported still). Propel and sling yourself through a multitude of intricate levels with your suit's thrusters and grapple hook, leveraging the strange alien fauna and flora. You'll also have to avoid the apex predators of this world, the colossal and terrifying worms that occasionally descend upon you, turning your escape into a heart-pounding race for survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/89a26257202c404e39d8448b2a7e41e6.poster.avif?t=1764933615\" width=506 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/89a26257202c404e39d8448b2a7e41e6.webm?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/89a26257202c404e39d8448b2a7e41e6.mp4?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete on the Leaderboard</h2>Faster speeds mean greater challenges and more excitement. Quick respawns ensure you're never far from the action, encouraging rapid iteration and mastery of your trajectory. Compete for supremacy on the leaderboard by shaving precious milliseconds off your best times.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/55cb6c229c91f9c4920e23174511424c.poster.avif?t=1764933615\" width=506 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/55cb6c229c91f9c4920e23174511424c.webm?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/extras/55cb6c229c91f9c4920e23174511424c.mp4?t=1764933615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility Built-In</h2>Not in a try-harding mood? Tailor your experience with adjustable parameters like lives, burst charges, and even game speed and enjoy the journey at your own pace. Immerse yourself in hand-drawn landscapes, from the eerie depths of subterranean caves to the vibrant expanse of a lush jungle, both teeming with alien life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2>Try to go as far as possible in a neverending chase with the worms in endless mode, picking up bonuses along the way. But be warned, each time you buff yourself the worm gets stronger too!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Not the brightest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/caff78f89760aca331ccff7058755233f7267155.jpg"},{"name":"Thinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/a05e2a2bcc72638fa89e7bffdecaef119bf5a913.jpg"},{"name":"Damn this jellyfish in particular","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/aa824e5154f1ac83ed854faafb8c96d4c12f4f83.jpg"},{"name":"Persistent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/fb9a4fab4181c47f6d4f8824ed1da17409f543c5.jpg"},{"name":"Power Rangers assemble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/26e7dc3bd5fdc58286fb44e7f230422fe56313c7.jpg"},{"name":"Invincible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/e63407af9e4d878bc4f1223dbfbf117af5a7b293.jpg"},{"name":"You madlad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/54071e6168371bc5780871f4e25f1121d1650f4b.jpg"},{"name":"World record holder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/27bbe355da4df61427cd3aa407965a7da477fad0.jpg"},{"name":"Finally safe?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/1c175ee7b427ee306e6dd3f81b71ac19ff5980bf.jpg"},{"name":"Marathon runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2852760/475aa49b228345f22fd8afbd06d5e752955e1e8e.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2852760?t=1764933615","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764933615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/8a4b67c4e1368c9af8b8ce642d9a848ca65b5bab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764933615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852760/8a4b67c4e1368c9af8b8ce642d9a848ca65b5bab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764933615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"descripti